      "text": "This itinerary brings together several distinct parts of Argentina in one trip. Start with 3 nights in Buenos Aires, a city of tango, historic neighbourhoods, broad avenues and European architecture. Then head to Mendoza, where vineyards reach the foothills of the Andes and you can get to know the region at the wineries of Luján de Cuyo."
